<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY DEC PPI UP 1 PCT M/M VS 1.1 PCT IN NOV.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY DEC PPI UP 1 PCT M/M VS 1.1 PCT IN NOV.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's December producer</p>
<p>prices rose by 1.0 percent from the previous month and were up</p>
<p>20.1 percent from a year ago, the Central Statistical Office</p>
<p>(KSH) said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>In November, the monthly rise was 1.1 percent while the</p>
<p>year-on-year rise was 19.7 percent.</p>
<p>    PRODUCER PRICES	   Dec 96   Nov 96    Dec 95</p>
<p> Montly change (pct)	   +1.0    +1.1	+0.6</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (pct)  +20.1   +19.7     +30.2</p>
<p>NOTE - The KSH said that domestic sales prices rose 0.7</p>
<p>percent month-on-month and 20.3 percent year-on-year. Export</p>
<p>prices, calculated in forints, rose two percent in December</p>
<p>from November and were 18.4 percent higher year-on-year.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
